    "body": "With #1184 merged Fetch no longer mentions the word \"payload\".\r\n\r\nI guess what we want to do is update the \"Bodies\" section with a note that indicates that what Fetch calls a body, HTTP calls content. (Or will soon: https://httpwg.org/http-core/draft-ietf-httpbis-semantics-latest.html#content.)\r\n\r\n@mnot does that seem right?",
